===========================================================================
URL:       https://huggingface.co/datasets/fm-universe/FM-bench-verified
License:   Apache-2.0
Citation:  FM-Bench-Verified (fm-universe)
File:      LICENSES/Apache-2.0-fm-bench-verified.txt
Affected:  cases/part5_mined/fm_bench_verified/**
Note:      Manually-cleaned + WP-verified benchmark (Code2Proof). 280 C programs,
           each with a property under verification AND a ground-truth ACSL
           specification; all 280 verified through Frama-C's WP. Assembled from
           three upstream sources (per-case in `[mined.fm_bench_verified].
           dataset_source`): FM-bench (incl. ACSL-by-Example, FRAMA-C-problems),
           AutoSpec, and Github repositories.
           Stored as double-version cases: `ground_truth.c` = upstream `output`
           (verified C+ACSL), `stripped.c` = upstream `input` (C + `//@ assert`
           goals, specs removed); `source_hash` binds to ground_truth.
           Apache-2.0 + small (~483 KB), so the C files are committed directly;
           reproduce via `tools/ingest_fm_bench_verified.py`.
           Overlap: ~45 cases originate (via FM-bench) from ACSL-by-Example, also
           ingested under cases/part3_curated/acsl_by_example/**; both kept (no
           dedup) — this is an independently cleaned + WP-verified reformulation.


